IT:
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}Ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Stavo chiedendo {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
di insegnarmi a fare il duro!
