{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Oh, ciao,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Capiti proprio a fagiolo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sto cercando di far sputare il rospo
