ma fa tutto il misterioso.
Dammi una mano a convincerlo!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yeah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Let's hear it!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} I gotta make
